<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-015" chapter-id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong" source-id="s-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong-ws1659582">
  <p id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p001:m0000" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn_A">緄</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p001:m0002" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn_AB">君蒨</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p001:m0005" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn_AB">懷簡</persName>，幼聰朗好學，尤長丁部書，問無不對。善弦歌，為梁<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p001:m0031" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w">湘東王</persName>鎮西諮議參軍。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">時襄陽<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0003" ref="awq_0ji_ba2">魚弘</persName>亦以豪侈稱，於是府中謠曰：「北路<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0021" ref="awq_0ji_ba2">魚</persName>，南路<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0025" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn_AB">徐</persName>。」然其服翫次於<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xujunqian-yuhong:p002:m0034" ref="awq_0ji_ba2">弘</persName>也。</p>
</text>
